[00:00.000 --> 00:04.400]  This is the fifth movie I've made recently where we try to understand
[00:04.400 --> 00:09.120]  technical diagrams drawn in crops by friendly extraterrestrials,
[00:09.120 --> 00:13.880]  by building models of those diagrams and see how they behave in a laboratory.
[00:13.880 --> 00:18.800]  So we know that they fly through space using a magnetic spinning propeller,
[00:18.800 --> 00:20.800]  like that, like a boat propeller,
[00:20.800 --> 00:23.560]  and those are lines of magnetic force, which you can see there.
[00:23.560 --> 00:25.000]  Pretty clear.
[00:30.000 --> 00:32.800]  Which makes a magnet spin and lift up in the middle.
[00:32.800 --> 00:35.680]  So, supposedly that's what makes the UFO lift up.
[00:35.680 --> 00:39.360]  So I've built that model here. We have six wire cause with three phase power
[00:39.360 --> 00:46.400]  arranges UU, VVW, I have a 70 millimeter magnet with a 14 millimeter hole in the middle
[00:46.400 --> 00:49.360]  on a 6.3 millimeter aluminum rod.
[00:49.360 --> 00:52.800]  And we have a silicone ball here, 20 millimeters,
[00:52.800 --> 00:56.320]  which will take the force on that magnet and transmit it to the rod without many
