[00:22.000 --> 00:24.000]  So we just put a little 100 millimeter thing there.
[00:25.000 --> 00:27.000]  It jumps up a little bit.
[00:27.000 --> 00:34.000]  Next if we put an 80 millimeter piece of aluminium, 3 millimeter stick again,
